       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SCORRCVR.
       AUTHOR.        BARBARA WINTER.
      *INSTALLATION.  GOODYEAR.
       DATE-WRITTEN.  SEP 1983 / JAN 1986.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *REMARKS.         RECEIVING SLIP CORRECTIONS PROGRAM.
      *D  MAIN PROGRAM FOR RECEIVING SLIP CORRECTIONS.
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************
      ***                   S C O R R C V R                     ***
      ***                                                       ***
      ***        THIS IS THE PROGRAM USED FOR MODIFYING         ***
      ***     RECEIVING SLIPS.  PURCHASE ORDER, RELEASE,        ***
      ***     AND RECEIVING NUMBER IS ENTERED AND VALIDATED.    ***
      ***     SPOOLER NUMBER DEFAULTS ARE DISPLAYED (UP TO 3)   ***
      ***     AND MAY BE MODIFIED BY THE USER.  THIS IS TO      ***
      ***     ALLOW SOME RECEIVING SLIP CORRECTIONS TO BE       ***
      ***     PRINTED IN AREAS OTHER THAN THE DOCK.             ***
      ***     ANY SPOOLER NUMBER CHANGES AREA VALIDATED.        ***
      ***                                                       ***
      ***     SPECIAL CHECKS:                                   ***
      ***        1.  AKRON PLANT - VALIDATE USERS AND           ***
      ***            RECEIVING DEPARTMENTS.                     ***
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************
      *C  08/31/93 JSB REQ #6422                                  *
      *C      DO NOT ALLOW THE CORRECTED QUANTITY TO BE BELOW ZERO*
      *C      IF BELOW ZERO THEN DISPLAY AN ERROR MESSAGE.        *
      *C
      *C  03/01/94 JEFF BUNGO
      *C      ADDED A RAW MATERIAL LOT NUMBER FIELD SO THAT UPDATES
      *C      TO THE RAW LOT NUMBER MAY BE DONE (WITHOUT CALLING ME)
      *C      THE UPDATED LOT NUMBER MUST NOT EXIST ALREADY FOR THE
      *C      CORP CODE AND SPACING OUT THE LOT NUMBER WILL RESULT
      *C      IN REMOVING THE LOT NUMBER.
      *C
      *C  05/04/94 JEFF BUNGO  REQUEST #6501
      *C      ADDED AN EDIT FOR THE CORRECTED QUANTITY FOR AUTO
      *C      STORE ITEMS SO THAT THE CORRECTED QUANTITY (WHEN LESS
      *C      THAN THE CURRENT RECEIVED QUANTITY) DOES NOT REDUCE
      *C      THE STOREROOM ONHAND BELOW ZERO.
      *C
      *C  06/10/94  JEFF BUNGO  REQUEST #6513
      *C      STORE THE REASON FOR CORRECTION IN A NEW DATASET
      *C      DRCVCORR (MCFPCS5400).
      *C
      *C  09/22/94  JEFF BUNGO
      *C      FOR AUTO STORE ITEMS, ADDED CODE TO HANDLE LOGIC
      *C      FOR CHAT NUMBER MODIFICATION AND TC341 FOR THE
      *C      CHAT INFO TO BE PASSED TO THE CHESS CORPORATE SYSTEM.
      *C
      *C  06/19/95  JEFF BUNGO
      *C      WRITE TC924 FOR CORRECTION QTY DLVR IF THAT QUANTITY
      *C      HAS A DECIMAL VALUE.
      *C
      *C  06/26/95  JEFF BUNGO
      *C      MOVED THE PO CURRENCY CODE TO THE TC324/424 TRANS.
      *C
      *C  06/28/95  JEFF BUNGO
      *C      USE THE PO QTY DLVR FOR THE CORRECTED QUANTITY WHEN
      *C      IT RETURNS FROM CVALITEM TO ENSURE THAT THE CORRECTED
      *C      QTY IS IN PO UM.  BEFORE, THE ADJUSTED QTY COULD HAVE
      *C      BEEN INCORRECT SINCE IT COULD HAVE BEEN CALCULATED
      *C      FROM THE DIFFERENCE OF TWO DIFFERENT UNIT OF MEAS.
      *C
      *C  12/05/95  CA YODER
      *C      COMMENTED OUT LOGIC TO CHECK IF THE RECEIVING SLIP
      *C      HAS A REGISTER NUMBER ASSIGNED FROM THE INVOICELESS
      *C      PROGRAM.  UNION CITY WAS HAVING A PROBLEM WITH
      *C      BACKING OUT A RECEIVING SLIP EVEN IF A CREDIT WAS
      *C      ISSUED TO CANCEL THE INVOICE.  THE RECEIVING SLIP
      *C      COULD NOT BE BACKED OUT SINCE IT JUST CHECKS FOR THE
      *C      EXISTENCE OF A REGISTER NUMBER.
      *C
      *C 06/06/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C      EXTEND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C
      *C  06/06/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C      REMOVE ESCAPE SEQUENCES FOR PRINTING MODIFY REPORT.
      *C      NO LONGER COMPRESS THE DATE, TIME, CODE DESC, AND
      *C      MODIFY EXPLANATION.
      *C
      *C 12/10/96   JEFF BUNGO  96-035
      *C      CHANGE QUANTITY ON DRCVTRAK FOR QS9000 TRACKING.
      *C
      *C SEPTEMBER 3, 1997  JEFF BUNGO
      *C      IF STORES RECEIPTS INTERFACE WITH AN EXTERNAL
      *C      SYSTEM (APPLICATION) AND ALL MATERIAL IS TO BE
      *C      AUTOSTORED (BASED ON MPLTINFO KEY SRX), THEN
      *C      MARK CODE AS AUTO STORE.  THEN CALL THE EXTERNAL
      *C      INTERFACE PROGRAM TO PASS THE DATA (RECEIVER,
      *C      ITEM NUMBER, CODE, QTY, UM, DATE, AND TIME).
      *C
      *C  11/25/97    JEFF BUNGO   REQ #97-017
      *C     ADD USAGE FIELDS FOR DIRECT DELIVERY.  DD USAGE
      *C     TO BE STORED IN ADDITIONAL FIELD AND TOTAL USAGE.
      *C     STORE ISSUE USAGE CALCULATED BY TOTAL USAGE - DD USAGE.
      *C     UPDATE THE DD USGAE WHEN THE TOTAL USAGE IS UPDATED
      *C     BY THE RECEIPT CORRECTION.
      *C
      *C  02/18/98     JEFF BUNGO
      *C     ON AN AUTOSTORE CORRECTION OF A FRANCHISE RCVG SLIP AND
      *C     FRANCHISED CODE, INDICATE FRANCHISER ON TC 325/425.
      *C
      *C  07/28/99     CA YODER
      *C     CHANGE TC 324 TO INCLUDE DES MOINES PLANT WHEN MOVING
      *C     NEW QUANTITY TO TC RECORD INSTEAD OF ADJUSTED QTY.
      *C
      *C  06/19/01     CA YODER
      *C     MOVED "04-AFTER-KELLY" PARAGRAPH NAME SO THAT THE "SRX"
      *C     AND "FRAN" SWITCHES WILL BE LOADED AND NOT SKIPPED.
      *C
      *C***********************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
       SPECIAL-NAMES. C01 IS NEW-PAGE
           I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
            SELECT ONLINE-PRT ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.
            SELECT ACCTG-PRT    ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT2.
            SELECT THIRD-PRT    ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT3.
      *SELECT ONLINE-PRT ASSIGN TO "SXXXXXXX,DA,A,DISC(CCTL),1024".
      *SELECT ACCTG-PRT  ASSIGN TO "SXXXXXXX,DA,A,DISC(CCTL),1024".
      *SELECT THIRD-PRT  ASSIGN TO "SXXXXXXX,DA,A,DISC(CCTL),1024".
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZUDCDOCK-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  RELATIVE KEY IS RELATIVE-RECNO
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
            SELECT MPLTINFO
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
            SELECT DDAILYTC
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1601
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
            SELECT DVENDOR
