       01  ACCTG-RCD.
           05  PRINT-ACCTG               PIC X(132).

       FD  THIRD-PRT
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
           RECORD CONTAINS 132 CHARACTERS
           DATA RECORD IS THIRD-RCD.
       01  THIRD-RCD.
           05  PRINT-THIRD               PIC X(132).
