           05  PRT-CODE                  PIC X(7)   VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(21)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  PRT-PREV-DLVR             PIC Z(7)9.9999 VALUE ZEROS.
           05  PRT-PREV-DLVR-R REDEFINES PRT-PREV-DLVR PIC Z(12)9.
           05  FILLER                    PIC XX     VALUE SPACES.
           05  PRT-PREV-DLVR-UM          PIC XX     VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER                    PIC XX     VALUE SPACES.
           05  PRT-PRES-DLVR             PIC Z(7)9.9999- VALUE ZEROS.
           05  PRT-PRES-DLVR-R REDEFINES PRT-PRES-DLVR PIC Z(12)9-.
           05  FILLER                    PIC X      VALUE SPACES.
           05  PRT-PRES-DLVR-UM          PIC XX     VALUE SPACES.
